+/*
+ * Runtime side of the LINUX_EFI_POISONED_MEMORY table: one bit per
+ * EFI_POISON_UNIT_SIZE, set here as frames go bad, honored by the next kernel.
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
